Package: swt6621s-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: dkms, make, gcc, bc, perl, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: linux-headers-generic | linux-headers
Description: SeekWave SWT6621S (SV6160LITE) wifi driver (DKMS)
 DKMS source for the SeekWave SWT6621S wifi/BT combo chip (reported as
 SV6160LITE/SV6160; SV6316 also supported), over USB (0x3607:0x6621) and
 SDIO (0x1FFE:0x6621).
 .
 This package ships the driver sources under /usr/src plus the USB and SDIO
 firmware blobs in /lib/firmware. DKMS rebuilds the modules automatically
 for every installed kernel.
